Package: loomer
Title: A High-Performance Auxiliary R Package for Analyzing the Danish Lifelines Dataset
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ilya", "Kashnitsky", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ilya.kashnitsky@gmail.com", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1835-8687"))
    )
Maintainer: Ilya Kashnitsky <ilya.kashnitsky@gmail.com>
Description: The {loomer} package modernizes how researchers interact with Lifelines dataset. By combining the blazing speed of the fastverse with customized codebooks, purpose-built demographic functions, and an accessible synthetic test environment, {loomer} improves computational efficiency and code portability.
